@startuml
title Selling seized PT collateral (BoringPtSeller logic)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF6F0
  BorderColor #2E8B67
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2E8B67
start
:Liquidator receives PT from the money market;
if (PT.isExpired()?) then (no)
  :market.swapExactPtForSy\n(reverts if PT share > 96 % or rate < 0);
else (yes)
  :YT.redeemPY: PT alone,\nSY = PT / pyIndexCurrent;
endif
:SY.redeem into a token of getTokensOut()\n(e.g. sUSDe only for SY-sUSDe);
:Sell the yield token for the loan token\n(DEX, or the issuer's own exit);
:Repay the loan, keep the bonus;
stop
@enduml
